================================================================================
Provenance
================================================================================

This plugin began as Ally Vibe Control by piyush-tyagi-13
(https://github.com/piyush-tyagi-13/ally-vibe-control, MIT) and was ported to
the Lenovo Legion Go in May 2026. M4ttiA contributed the per-game profiles
while the project was still under MIT.

Most of what is here now was written after that port and is under the BSD
3-Clause License. Code inherited from the earlier work survives in main.py,
src/index.tsx, README.md, package.json and plugin.json, and remains under the
MIT License, whose text and copyright notices are kept verbatim in LICENSE.MIT.
MIT permits this sublicensing precisely so long as its notice travels with the
code, so both licence files ship together and both must be kept by anyone
redistributing this plugin.

Files carrying no inherited code - lego_updater.py, everything under tests/,
the build configuration and the workflow - are BSD 3-Clause alone.

