A copy of the LGPL-2.1 license text is included in the header of every
bundled pyudev source file. The full text is also available at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html

Because pyudev is used as an unmodified, dynamically imported library and is
redistributed in its original source form, the plugin's own source keeps the
terms set out above. Anyone redistributing this plugin must keep this notice
